<section class="py-40 bg-zinc-950 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
            <div
                class="p-16 bg-zinc-900 rounded-[3rem] border-l-8 border-red-600 space-y-10 group hover:bg-red-600 transition-all duration-500"
            >
                <h3
                    class="text-5xl font-black italic text-white uppercase group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                >
                    01 / POWER
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-xl text-zinc-500 font-medium italic group-hover:text-white/80"
                >
                    Hipertrofia máxima através de protocolos de tensão mecânica
                    e estresse metabólico.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="p-16 bg-zinc-900 rounded-[3rem] border-l-8 border-white space-y-10 group hover:grayscale transition-all duration-500"
            >
                <h3
                    class="text-5xl font-black italic text-white uppercase transform rotate-2"
                >
                    02 / ENDURE
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xl text-zinc-500 font-medium italic">
                    Condicionamento cardiovascular de elite para atletas de alta
                    performance.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div
                class="p-16 bg-red-600 rounded-[3rem] space-y-10 shadow-3xl shadow-red-600/20"
            >
                <h3 class="text-5xl font-black italic text-white uppercase">
                    03 / MINDY
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xl text-white/80 font-medium italic">
                    A disciplina é o único caminho para a liberdade. Construa
                    uma mente inabalável.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
